Improved using Qwen.

This repository contains an independently trained PEFT/LoRA adapter for
stanford-oval/churro-3B. It does not contain the CHURRO or Qwen base-model
weights. The adapter is not an official Stanford OVAL, Alibaba Cloud/Qwen, or
Library of Congress release.

Training and evaluation used scans from the Abraham Lincoln Papers. Credit:
Library of Congress, Manuscript Division, Abraham Lincoln Papers.
